sequenceDiagram
    participant PlatformOp as Platform Operator<br/>(odh-operator / rhods-operator)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Controller as trainer-operator<br/>Controller Manager
    participant AppNS as Application Namespace
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>(via PodMonitor)
    participant Metrics as Metrics Endpoint<br/>8080/TCP HTTP

    Note over PlatformOp,Controller: Flow 1: Trainer CR Reconciliation

    PlatformOp->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Trainer CR (default-trainer)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Watch event (Trainer CR changed)

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Controller,K8sAPI: Reconciliation Pipeline
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Check JobSetOperator status (OpenShift)<br/>or JobSet CRD existence (K8s)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: Dependency status

        alt Dependencies not met
            Controller->>K8sAPI: Update Trainer status (Degraded)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
        else Dependencies satisfied
            Controller->>K8sAPI: Ensure target namespace exists<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
            K8sAPI-->>Controller: Namespace ready

            Controller->>K8sAPI: Render & apply manifests<br/>(Server-Side Apply)<br/>Deployments, Services, CRDs,<br/>TrainingRuntimes, ImageStreams<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
            K8sAPI-->>Controller: Resources applied

            Controller->>K8sAPI: Monitor deployment health<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
            K8sAPI-->>Controller: Health status

            Controller->>K8sAPI: Garbage collect stale resources<br/>(previous versions)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
            K8sAPI-->>Controller: GC complete

            Controller->>K8sAPI: Update Trainer status (Ready)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
        end
    end

    Note over Prometheus,Metrics: Flow 2: Metrics Collection

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create PodMonitor resource<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    Prometheus->>Metrics: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP plaintext (no TLS)<br/>Auth: None
    Metrics-->>Prometheus: Prometheus metrics response
